## 3. How we use your information

We use information to:

- Create and manage your account and profile
- Show you other users and a coarse distance label
- Operate matching, chat, communities, prompt games, gifts, subscriptions, modes, house parties, and events
- Deliver safety alerts and date details to the trusted contacts you selected
- Calculate profile tags from behavior ratings
- Send push notifications about matches, messages, gifts, safety alerts, parties, and events, according to your notification settings
- Validate purchases and add the corresponding gift stock to your account
- Review verification submissions, support tickets, and user reports, and enforce our Terms and Community Guidelines
- Improve safety, prevent fraud and abuse, and comply with law
- Analyze aggregated usage to improve the App

We **do not** sell your personal information.

---

## 4. How we share information

| Recipient | What we share and why |
|-----------|------------------------|
| **Other Zynq users** | Profile fields you choose to display, such as photos, name, age, bio, interests, voice prompts, salary band, game answers you chose to show, and your profile tag. Blind Date may hide photos until reveal. They see a coarse distance label, not your exact GPS, in discovery. |
| **Community members** | Messages, images, and voice notes you post in a community you join, and your membership. |
| **Trusted contacts you add** | During a safety session you start: your name, the kind of alert (panic or date share), precise latitude and longitude while the session is active, the time of that location, and date details when a date share is allowed. This is limited to trusted contacts who also have a Zynq account. |
| **Google Firebase** | Authentication, Firestore, Realtime Database, file storage, Cloud Functions, analytics, and push messaging. [Firebase Privacy](https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy) |
| **Google (Sign-In and Gemini)** | Sign-in credentials you use with Google; draft text you submit to Rephrase. |
| **Google Play / Apple App Store** | Purchase tokens and product identifiers for subscriptions and gift bundles. |
| **Law enforcement or other legal recipients** | When required by law, or to protect the safety and rights of users or the public. |

We do not show your exact live GPS on discovery cards. We do share precise coordinates with your chosen trusted contacts for the length of a safety session you start.

