## 7. Your choices and rights

Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict processing of your personal data.

**In the App you can:**

- Edit your profile, including salary band, voice prompts, and which game answers are visible
- Control notification preferences
- Add or remove trusted contacts
- Delete your account permanently
- Revoke location, camera, microphone, notification, or photo permissions in device settings

**To exercise other privacy requests,** email info@ezigboe.com from the address linked to your account. We may need to verify your identity before processing the request.

